	(text "SAFE latch (D-62, D-75, D-84): LATCHED = 1 after a power-up or any loss of SAFE loop current.\nOnly a RESET press clears it, and only while the loop current is present (PRE_N high). A held button gives no new edge.\nTX_EN = NOR(FAULT, LATCHED) goes to every radio port: TX INH and keying need TX_EN high (D-71).\nPOR_N: second TPS3823A-33 with WDI open (watchdog off), independent of the MCU watchdog (U3).\nLEDs on the front panel: SAFE = loop current present; LATCHED = stop held, RESET needed.\nLabels on the same sides as the root block (D-92). SAFE_LOST crosses FAULT and LATCHED: these wires are not connected (no junction)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f6664cf-4f55-500e-b2b5-d3fd8ce8eea2")
	)
